<div><strong>Time</strong></div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Hours / o'clock</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">点钟</div>
        <div class="col">number + diǎn-zhōng</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>Minutes</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">分</div>
        <div class="col">number + fēn</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>Quarter of an hour</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">刻</div>
        <div class="col">number + kè</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>Morning (a.m.)</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">上午</div>
        <div class="col">shàng-wǔ + time</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>Afternoon (p.m.)</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">下午</div>
        <div class="col">xià-wǔ + time</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>What time is it?</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">几点钟?</div>
    <div>jǐ diǎn-zhōng?</div>
    <div><strong>Dates are expressed as</strong></div>
    <div>Year-Month-Day Weekday a.m./p.m. Hours-Minutes-Seconds</div>
    <div>year + <strong>nián</strong> + month + <strong>yuè</strong> + day + <strong>hào/rì</strong></div>
    <div>30th June 1997</div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">一九九七年六月三十号/日</div>
    <div>yí-jiǔ-jiǔ-qī-nián liù-yuè sānshí-hào/rì</div>
    <div><strong>2 o'clock</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">两点钟</div>
        <div class="col">liǎng-diǎn-zhōng</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>3:05</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">三点(零)五分</div>
        <div class="col">sān-diǎn (líng) wǔ-fēn</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>4:15</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">四点十五分</div>
        <div class="col">sì-diǎn shíwǔ-fēn</div>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">四点一刻</div>
        <div class="col">sì-diǎn yí-kè</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>5:30</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">五点三十分</div>
        <div class="col">wǔ-diǎn sānshí-fēn</div>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">五点半</div>
        <div class="col">wǔ-diǎn bàn</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>6:45</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">六点四十五分</div>
        <div class="col">liù-diǎn sìshíwǔ-fēn</div>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">六点三刻</div>
        <div class="col">liù-diǎn sān-kè</div>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">差一刻七点</div>
        <div class="col">chà-yí-kè qī-diǎn</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>7:50</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">七点五十分</div>
        <div class="col">qī-diǎn wǔshí-fēn</div>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">差十分八点</div>
        <div class="col">chà-shí-fēn bā-diǎn</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>4:35 p.m. on Tuesday</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">星期二下午四点三十五分</div>
    <div>xīngqī'èr xià-wǔ sì-diǎn sānshíwǔ-fēn</div>
</div>
<div><strong>Money</strong></div>
<div class="row grammar-cell">
    <div><strong>Official currency is yuán (¥)</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">元</div>
        <div class="col">yuán</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>1/10 of a yuán</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">角</div>
        <div class="col">jiǎo</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>1/10 of a jiǎo</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">分</div>
        <div class="col">fēn</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>Bank notes use the accountancy set of numerals</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">拾元/拾圆</div>
        <div class="col">shí-yuán</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>Whole dollar values use (colloquial)</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">块</div>
        <div class="col">kuài</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>1/10 of a kuài</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">毛</div>
        <div class="col">máo</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>1/10 of a máo</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">分</div>
        <div class="col">fēn</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>Official Currency</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">人民币</div>
        <div class="col">rénmínbì (RMB)</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>¥3.5</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">三块五</div>
    <div>sān-kuài wǔ(-máo)</div>
    <div><strong>¥27.05</strong></div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">二十七块零五分</div>
    <div>èrshíqī-kuài líng wǔ-fēn</div>
    <div><strong>¥3</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">三块钱</div>
        <div class="col">sān-kuài-qián</div>
    </div>
    <div><strong>¥2.2</strong></div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col grammar-verbs-ideograms">两块二</div>
        <div class="col">liǎng-kuài èr</div>
    </div>
</div>
